<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-[68px] md:py-[110px]">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.05em] uppercase text-primary mb-[10px] text-center">Reliability</p>
    <h1 class="text-[42px] md:text-[68px] font-bold text-ink mb-[26px] text-center">Quality Assurance</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-[68px] leading-8">Contech Concrete follows strict quality checks from the planning stage to the delivery stage. Every batch of RCC pipes is tested to ensure compliance with international standards.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-[26px] mb-[68px]">
        <div class="bg-white border border-line p-[26px] border-l-4 border-primary">
            <h2 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ink mb-4">Raw Material Examination</h2>
            <p class="text-slate leading-7">Cement, steel, and sand are procured from established vendors and inspected thoroughly upon arrival. Materials are sent to the automated batching plant only after approval.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-line p-[26px] border-l-4 border-primary">
            <h2 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ink mb-4">In-Process Quality Control</h2>
            <p class="text-slate leading-7">Manufacturing runs under the strict supervision of highly qualified staff. A variety of tests are conducted throughout production to catch defects early.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-line p-[26px] border-l-4 border-accent bg-neutral">
            <h2 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ink mb-4">Final Testing</h2>
            <p class="text-slate leading-7">Rigorous testing is performed for every batch of products at random to ensure international standard compliance before dispatch.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.05em] uppercase text-primary mb-[10px] text-center">Testing Equipment</p>
    <h2 class="text-[42px] font-bold text-ink mb-[10px] text-center">Two Tests, Guaranteed Pipes</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate text-center mb-[42px]">Two specialised tests guarantee structural integrity and leak-proof performance.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-[26px] max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-white border border-line p-[26px]">
            <h3 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ink mb-4">Three Edge Bearing Load Test</h3>
            <p class="text-slate leading-7 mb-4">Load is applied on the pipe through a jack until the pipe cracks. The pipe passes if the load conditions per IS 458:2003 specifications are satisfied.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-7">Validates structural strength at the 0.25&nbsp;mm crack load and ultimate load for each diameter.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-line p-[26px]">
            <h3 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ink mb-4">Hydro Test</h3>
            <p class="text-slate leading-7 mb-4">Water pressure is applied from a pump to the pipe covered on all sides, determining the pressure it withstands before leaking. Approved if compatible with the ISI specification.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-7">Guarantees leak-proof, non-reactive performance in sewage and drainage applications.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>